---
// A short introduction to who's behind it, leading to the about page.
import { url, OWNER, LOCATION } from '../../site';
---

<section id="about" class="section wrap" aria-labelledby="about-title">
  <div class="bento">
    <div class="tile c5 tone-soft who pop">
      <div class="me">
        <span class="avatar" aria-hidden="true">CT</span>
        <div>
          <h2 id="about-title" class="name">{OWNER}</h2>
          <p class="muted">{LOCATION} · remote</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <blockquote class="pull">
        <p>"Problem solving is what I do best, whether the problem sits in the code, the platform or the team."</p>
      </blockquote>
      <a class="more" href={url('about/')}>More about me <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
    </div>
    <div class="tile c7 pop">
      <p class="label">a bit about me</p>
      <p class="para">
        I'm a full-stack engineer across UI, back end, infrastructure and AI, and I've led engineering teams for 12+
        years. I've reported to CEOs and boards in plain English, sat in on sales and due-diligence calls as the technical
        voice, and been the person on call when things broke.
      </p>
      <p class="para">
        That mix is what I bring: someone who can change the pipeline themselves, explain why it matters to the people
        paying for it, and leave the team better able to carry on.
      </p>
      <dl class="kv">
        <dt>experience</dt>
        <dd>20+ years, 12+ leading teams</dd>
        <dt>stack</dt>
        <dd>TypeScript, Node.js, React, AWS, Terraform, Playwright</dd>
        <dt>ai</dt>
        <dd>Claude Code, AI review in CI, Mastra and Amazon Bedrock</dd>
        <dt>education</dt>
        <dd>MEng Electronic &amp; Computer Engineering, Newcastle University</dd>
      </dl>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .who {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 24px;
  }
  .me {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 16px;
  }
  .avatar {
    flex: none;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    width: 84px;
    height: 84px;
    border-radius: 24px;
    background: var(--acc);
    color: var(--on-acc);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 1.875rem;
  }
  .name {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 1.375rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.015em;
  }
  .pull {
    margin: 0;
  }
  .pull p {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    line-height: 1.35;
    letter-spacing: -0.015em;
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  .para {
    margin: 0 0 14px !important;
  }
  .kv {
    margin-top: 18px;
  }
</style>
